{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":509016,\"title\":\"The Dead King\",\"tagline\":\"A glorious backfire!\",\"overview\":\"Chasing down wretched souls who leave no trace is the curse of Detective Bosworth. He really just wanted to call it a night, but a dubious phone call just before midnight lures him back into the game. Cornered by his nemesis, Bosworth finds himself the target of a bizarre power play.\\r A black-humored parable of human hubris. A precisely timed finale in which the opponent's vanity becomes the most unpredictable downfall.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/62WEJfM1nLbcW0YkaN7ir2JjXwZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ir5X6MMTF8wNELslDA69VdDBqHw.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":2015,\"runtime\":8,\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Denis Girisken\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1989725,\"name\":\"Denis Girisken\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9CCFrkzDbOqtkjW3ynxG9hmgMqe.jpg\"},{\"id\":1989748,\"name\":\"Michel Götsche\",\"character\":\"Detective Bosworth\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1989749,\"name\":\"Michael Rahn\",\"character\":\"Dick Larry\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1989750,\"name\":\"Judith Jäger\",\"character\":\"Ms. Summersby\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":5236,\"title\":\"Kiss Kiss Bang Bang\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aWfjIkpENFX6Uw82pET7EQ6jnrd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kKdBNPXfjENj3wG5qtiCrZ2wflp.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A petty thief posing as an actor is brought to Los Angeles for an unlikely audition and finds himself in the middle of a murder investigation along with his high school dream girl and a detective who's been training him for his upcoming role...\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":534780,\"title\":\"Andhadhun\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dy3K6hNvwE05siGgiLJcEiwgpdO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/73aKTjdQ46jpv3InqNVnV76Nl0K.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A series of mysterious events changes the life of a blind pianist who now must report a crime that was actually never witnessed by him.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":385332,\"title\":\"Terminal\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xi7pA3lL6Wb78p6Y6PgWoHDMjrM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8K5S5W0te4FJ0GVRHcPYPETWwLA.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the dark heart of a sprawling, anonymous city, two assassins carry out a sinister mission, a teacher battles a fatal illness, and an enigmatic janitor and a curious waitress lead dangerous double lives.  Murderous consequences unravel in the dead of night, as their lives intertwine at the hands of a mysterious criminal mastermind who is hell-bent on revenge.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10743,\"title\":\"Confidence\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yJzmAtY9DmhhjJwFnW0Zjlvz6yg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g5woRbuOrwynegzoMKOg8GmMf0j.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"What Jake Vig doesn't know just might get him killed. A sharp and polished grifter, Jake has just swindled thousands of dollars from the unsuspecting Lionel Dolby with the help of his crew. It becomes clear that Lionel wasn't just any mark, he was an accountant for eccentric crime boss Winston King. Jake and his crew will have to stay one step ahead of both the criminals and the cops to finally settle their debt.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":194523,\"title\":\"Blind Detective\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/enYIEP15dUD2t0G5wAaZ8U4uxyX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j0Rn7GejlFhKNunk0Wj0lupMP7g.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A brilliant detective is forced into early retirement after losing eyesight. Making ends meet by solving cold cases for reward money, he teams up with a rookie lady inspector to solve a case from her personal past.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":27004,\"title\":\"Ca$h\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e5B7nG6xREL6lNnS34ZoAvXbB9l.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yRrU6B1lVxftuM4PYnR6MqAxHWr.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A stroke of good luck turns lethal for Sam Phelan and his wife Leslie when they are faced with a life-changing decision that brings strange and sinister Pyke Kubic to their doorstep. As Pyke leads Sam and Leslie on a tumultuous adventure through the streets of Chicago, each are pulled deeper and deeper into a desperate spiral of deception and violence – all in the name of money.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Thriller\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":61537,\"title\":\"Burn Notice: The Fall of Sam Axe\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wgQuP4qrsjw4kNgR3sYQeaCNllm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lpYER5hPpg1NHki8EVmcDeWi1vs.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Before Sam Axe teamed up with Michael and Fiona, he was Commander Axe, U.S. Navy SEAL. The Fall of Sam Axe tells the story of how Sam went from respected Naval Commander to the man of mystery we've come to know on Burn Notice. On what will turn out to be Sam's last military mission, he is sent to the jungles of Colombia to investigate claims of a vicious terrorist organization known only as the \\\"Espada Ardiente\\\" (Flaming Sword). His mission: to determine whether U.S. military aid is necessary to deal with the threat. But when he arrives, things are more complicated than he'd imagined. He receives word that the rebels have targeted a small civilian clinic deep in the jungle. Sam must now save the clinic's doctors and patients from certain death. However, nothing is as it seems and the Espada Ardiente may not be the biggest threat Sam Axe faces.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":915831,\"title\":\"Monica, O My Darling\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4GvYW5pQPSw4gxSLBnOkXF2bZbf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/szov0Tr05mP7rKHlG2VYyWh33wx.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A slick robotics expert joins a murderous plot after a passionate affair takes a sudden turn, but nothing — not even death — is what it seems to be.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12487,\"title\":\"Gozu\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mo5L0XzMYmLhdsvgA40qlYiHhAF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wrV17pXZjFnnUtdGYZaz9q7mslR.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Minami mistakenly kills a gangster associate of his named Brother. Almost as soon as the murder takes place, the body of the deceased man is gone, prompting Minami to conduct a search. While looking, he finds a mysterious isolated hotel where he decides to take a rest. Not only are the front desk clerks a bit strange, but even the ambiance feels unusual. Minami soon realizes he may have gotten more than he bargained for.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":38087,\"title\":\"Mystery Team\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AbqRb1hlCb8jPVqFXL5hwrj8hQO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j0Vk3K98HVsMq7b4NafV4s9wxB5.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A group of former Encyclopedia Brown-style child-detectives struggle to solve an adult mystery.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":476197,\"title\":\"Serial Cook\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fZsxuy1BNdwENAwQHOVxuCWgZ6F.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jSMtZpenF6kJgTbCakLjzmXnukg.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Meet Neslihan. A perfect cook, an expert on Turkish cuisine, strictly loyal to her husband, an impeccable house wife... and a serial killer.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21469,\"title\":\"Across the Hall\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eH92tHb7A3jrPw0OBgwZeBWKlk1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l7IhQJnI9BXWntyYuHfW8hc2KMN.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Convinced that his fiancee is cheating on him, a man follows her to a hotel and calls his best friend to help him avoid a calamity.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"qL0Q-xTRxMM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"nDIQmhpScPI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"rvPrkfUgU-A\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}